### 1. List Webhook Deliveries
# @name listDeliveries
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/deliveries?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}

###

### 2. Inspect an Individual Delivery and its Attempt History
# @name getDelivery
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}

###

### 3. Manually Retry an Exhausted or Failed Webhook Delivery
# @name retryDelivery
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 4. Force Retry a Webhook Delivery
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forced": true
}
